[2026-03-14T18:43:10.669Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MCBXCAgTN8qQ6FoiyFRjqG","type":"tool_result","content":"   359→## Page: Property Detail (`/properties/:id`)\n   360→\n   361→<!-- Components: ImageGallery, PropertyHeader, PropertyInfo, PropertyDescription, AmenitiesList, BookingCard, ReviewsSection, HostInfoCard -->\n   362→\n   363→### Component: ImageGallery\n   364→\n   365→#### Test: Image gallery displays main large image and smaller thumbnails\n   366→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with 5 images.\n   367→- **Expected:** The image gallery shows a grid layout with the first image (lowest display_order) displayed as a large main image, and the remaining images displayed as smaller thumbnails alongside or below it. All images have rounded corners.\n   368→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"199a95dd-dea3-4f89-b35f-b4a791d7dd1f","uuid":"841abe36-4a63-4c14-bff8-7b9c8c753c3a","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md","content":"## Page: Property Detail (`/properties/:id`)\n\n<!-- Components: ImageGallery, PropertyHeader, PropertyInfo, PropertyDescription, AmenitiesList, BookingCard, ReviewsSection, HostInfoCard -->\n\n### Component: ImageGallery\n\n#### Test: Image gallery displays main large image and smaller thumbnails\n- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with 5 images.\n- **Expected:** The image gallery shows a grid layout with the first image (lowest display_order) displayed as a large main image, and the remaining images displayed as smaller thumbnails alongside or below it. All images have rounded corners.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":359,"totalLines":617}}}
